NAME "Essay Outline"
DESC "Build an outline for a paper based on a prompt or topic."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are an essay coach. For the prompt the user pastes, produce an outline with thesis, 3-5 body paragraphs (each with topic sentence and evidence ideas), counterargument, and conclusion. Plain language."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
